{"results":[{"entryType":"UniProtKB reviewed (Swiss-Prot)","primaryAccession":"Q15811","uniProtkbId":"ITSN1_HUMAN","proteinDescription":{"recommendedName":{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000305"}],"value":"Intersectin-1"}},"alternativeNames":[{"fullName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"9465890"}],"value":"SH3 domain-containing protein 1A"}},{"fullName":{"value":"SH3P17"}}]},"genes":[{"geneName":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000312","source":"HGNC","id":"HGNC:6183"}],"value":"ITSN1"},"synonyms":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"10482960"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"9799604"}],"value":"ITSN"},{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000303","source":"PubMed","id":"9465890"}],"value":"SH3D1A"}]}],"comments":[{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250","source":"UniProtKB","id":"Q9WVE9"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250","source":"UniProtKB","id":"Q9Z0R4"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11584276"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11744688"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"22648170"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"29887380"}],"value":"Adapter protein that provides a link between the endocytic membrane traffic and the actin assembly machinery (PubMed:11584276, PubMed:29887380). Acts as a guanine nucleotide exchange factor (GEF) for CDC42, and thereby stimulates actin nucleation mediated by WASL and the ARP2/3 complex (PubMed:11584276). Plays a role in the assembly and maturation of clathrin-coated vesicles (By similarity). Recruits FCHSD2 to clathrin-coated pits (PubMed:29887380). Involved in endocytosis of activated EGFR, and probably also other growth factor receptors (By similarity). Involved in endocytosis of integrin beta-1 (ITGB1) and transferrin receptor (TFR); internalization of ITGB1 as DAB2-dependent cargo but not TFR may involve association with DAB2 (PubMed:22648170). Promotes ubiquitination and subsequent degradation of EGFR, and thereby contributes to the down-regulation of EGFR-dependent signaling pathways. In chromaffin cells, required for normal exocytosis of catecholamines. Required for rapid replenishment of release-ready synaptic vesicles at presynaptic active zones (By similarity). Inhibits ARHGAP31 activity toward RAC1 (PubMed:11744688)"}],"commentType":"FUNCTION"},{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250","source":"UniProtKB","id":"Q9Z0R4"}],"value":"Plays a role in synaptic vesicle endocytosis in brain neurons"}],"commentType":"FUNCTION","molecule":"Isoform 1"},{"commentType":"SUBCELLULAR LOCATION","note":{"texts":[{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"20946875"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"29030480"}],"value":"Colocalizes with SGIP1 at the plasma membrane in structures corresponding most probably to clathrin-coated pits (PubMed:20946875). Colocalizes with RAB13 on cytoplasmic vesicles that are most likely recycling endosomes (PubMed:29030480)"}]},"subcellularLocations":[{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11744688"}],"value":"Endomembrane system","id":"SL-0147"}},{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000250","source":"UniProtKB","id":"Q9WVE9"}],"value":"Synapse, synaptosome","id":"SL-0261"}},{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11744688"}],"value":"Cell projection, lamellipodium","id":"SL-0291"}},{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"11744688"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"20946875"}],"value":"Cell membrane","id":"SL-0039"}},{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"20946875"},{"evidenceCode":"ECO:0000269","source":"PubMed","id":"29887380"}],"value":"Membrane, clathrin-coated pit","id":"SL-0069"}},{"location":{"evidences":[{"evidenceCode